sequenceDiagram
  participant GH as GitHub Actions
  participant CB as Cloud Build
  participant AR as Artifact Registry
  participant BA as Binary Authorization
  participant CD as Cloud Deploy
  participant ST as GKE staging
  participant PR as GKE production
  GH->>CB: Submit tested commit
  CB->>CB: Go tests + container builds + SBOM
  CB->>AR: Push immutable images
  CB-->>GH: Verified build, digests, SBOM and provenance
  GH->>BA: Create KMS-backed attestations
  GH->>CD: Create release with digests
  CD->>ST: Render and deploy
  ST-->>CD: Verification result
  CD-->>GH: Await production approval
  GH->>CD: Approve rollout
  CD->>PR: Deploy same digests
  GH->>BA: Temporary enforce/deny/allow lab, then disable
  PR-->>CD: Post-deploy verification
